# ⚠️ PAYMENT GATEWAY KEYS — DO NOT ADD HERE!
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Payment keys are managed in the DATABASE (payment_gateways table).
# Frontend fetches them via: GET /api/checkout/active-gateways
